1 finding(s): 1 to fix; 1 on their lines. Reply in a comment's thread to answer it.

### Summary

The change to `workspaces/index.ts` adds provider detection and an availability probe to the relocate handler, and returns the workspace view. It has one problem. When the active workspace is relocated, the new folder's provider is detected only after `relocateActive` has committed and broadcast. A Google Drive folder recognised only by its xattr (outside `~/Library/CloudStorage`) is therefore listed as plain on the first re-list. No later `library:changed` corrects that. Add and create both detect before their switch. None of the open threads touch this file, so there are no thread replies.

